# Leave unset to use the built-in mock transport (realistic latency, generated
# reference numbers, and a `fail@…` email address to exercise the error UI).
#
# Set this to switch every form over to a real backend. Expected endpoints:
#   POST /contact     POST /booking     POST /newsletter
#
# ⚠️ If your forms ever collect clinical information, this endpoint and everything
#    behind it must be HIPAA-compliant, with a Business Associate Agreement in place.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
